:1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1809256458,"text":"モンド城が混乱に落ちている中、それに乗じて悪巧みをしている人たちがいるの。","nextNodeIds":[411240206,411240208]},{"nodeId":411240206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3828103282,"text":"宝盗団…のこと？","nextNodeIds":[411240207]},{"nodeId":411240207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2109835378,"text":"あら、さすが百戦錬磨の冒険者ね。鋭いじゃない。","nextNodeIds":[411240212]},{"nodeId":411240212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1516150522,"text":"すでに西風騎士が警戒を上げたけど、何せ他の問題も多くて、完全な警備はできていないわ。","nextNodeIds":[411240213]},{"nodeId":411240213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1338581066,"text":"お金のためなら何でもする宝盗団は、この隙を狙って「荒稼ぎ」しようとしているでしょうね。","nextNodeIds":[411240214,411240217]},{"nodeId":411240214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3685465522,"text":"どうすればいい？","nextNodeIds":[411240215]},{"nodeId":411240215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":734586826,"text":"あら、あっさりと引き受けてくれたわね。","nextNodeIds":[411240216]},{"nodeId":411240216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1365609522,"text":"アハハ、どうやら、あの方が教えてくれた方法は使う必要がなかったわね。","nextNodeIds":[411240222]},{"nodeId":411240222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2148812298,"text":"簡単に言うと…モンド城周辺を偵察していた宝盗団のメンバーは、すでにあの方が捕えたわ。","nextNodeIds":[411240223]},{"nodeId":411240223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":3008812682,"text":"そいつによると、3隊ほどの宝盗団が悪巧みをしているとか。","nextNodeIds":[411240224]},{"nodeId":411240224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":42531442,"text":"そこで私たちは、「最高の侵入地点」を宝盗団のために用意したの。","nextNodeIds":[411240225,411240226]},{"nodeId":411240225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":606550122,"text":"どうすればいい？","nextNodeIds":[411240231]},{"nodeId":411240231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1079067762,"text":"君がやるべきことは簡単。","nextNodeIds":[411240232]},{"nodeId":411240232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1619165450,"text":"偵察に来た宝盗団は、慎重にことを運ぶために、直接戻って報告ではなく、情報を手紙に記して報告する。","nextNodeIds":[411240233]},{"nodeId":411240233,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":213083002,"text":"しかもいざという時のために、三人偵察に向かわせてきてる。それも三人別々に分かれてね。","nextNodeIds":[411240234]},{"nodeId":411240234,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":3475906906,"text":"でも、その三人が全員あの方に捕われたなんて、あいつら絶対思いもつかないわ…","nextNodeIds":[411240235]},{"nodeId":411240235,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":4019304066,"text":"偵察からの報告を受けてから、計画を作成する。最高の侵入地点のために。","nextNodeIds":[411240236]},{"nodeId":411240236,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":603775210,"text":"でも今回は、あの方がすでに侵入地点をあいつらのために用意した。","nextNodeIds":[411240237]},{"nodeId":411240237,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2915535474,"text":"この三つの手紙をあげるわ。これらを三か所の約束場所に置いてきて。","nextNodeIds":[411240238]},{"nodeId":411240238,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1395792074,"text":"置いたら、ここに戻って私に言って。後のことは…その時に言うわ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":411240226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2841238514,"text":"宝盗団が言ったことを信じるの？","nextNodeIds":[411240227]},{"nodeId":411240227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1554286434,"text":"アハハ、中々考えがあるわね。安心して、宝盗団にそんな骨がある者はいないわ。","nextNodeIds":[411240228]},{"nodeId":411240228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":195664066,"text":"あいつら、ただ金銭に群がるチンピラよ。","nextNodeIds":[411240229]},{"nodeId":411240229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":3391205730,"text":"「私たちと組めばもっとお金が、じゃないと破産させられる。」","nextNodeIds":[411240230]},{"nodeId":411240230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":333444650,"text":"このことを叩き込めば、すぐに素直になるわ。","nextNodeIds":[411240231]},{"nodeId":411240217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1070864746,"text":"西風騎士たちが片付ける。","nextNodeIds":[411240218]},{"nodeId":411240218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":3521430642,"text":"あら、やっぱりそう言うのね。","nextNodeIds":[411240219]},{"nodeId":411240219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":4211356314,"text":"安心して、あの方から予算はたくさん貰ったから、報酬は少なくないわ。","nextNodeIds":[411240220]},{"nodeId":411240220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":140335402,"text":"依頼の途中で獲得した物も、自分で取っといて。","nextNodeIds":[411240221]},{"nodeId":411240221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2471647874,"text":"それに、この事は君じゃないとだめなの。","nextNodeIds":[411240222]},{"nodeId":411240208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2186914986,"text":"ヒルチャール…のこと？","nextNodeIds":[411240209]},{"nodeId":411240209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":290633650,"text":"アハハ、何考えてるの、ヒルチャールはそんなことできないわよ。","nextNodeIds":[411240210]},{"nodeId":411240210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":690508882,"text":"城の周辺に来たら、西風騎士にやっつけられるるだけよ。","nextNodeIds":[411240211]},{"nodeId":411240211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2676870778,"text":"私が言った悪巧みしている人たちは、宝盗団よ。","nextNodeIds":[411240212]}]},{"talkId":4112452,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":fa